      [#D7D7AF][/dim]tellable apart at a glance.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase/repos/plans/202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]common_placeholder_tags.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Placeholder candidate sources and common-tag input in [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase core — sase-core: candidate sources and common-tag input' [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section: extend the Rust placeholder completion engine so candidates [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]carry a prompt/common source, accept a caller-supplied common-tag list, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and emit prompt-local candidates before common ones; update the PyO3 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]binding, the xprompt LSP call sites, and the version contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable common-placeholder store and prompt recording hook[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]store[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase store — durable common-placeholder store' section: add a capped, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]atomically-written JSON store of placeholder tags ranked by use count, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record tags from every submitted or abandoned prompt through the shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt-history choke points, and seed the store once from existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt history.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Config field, warm cache, and completion menu wiring[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wiring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase wiring — config, warm cache, and menu behavior' section: add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace.prompt_completion.common_placeholder_count config field, warm the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]store off-thread into an app-level cache, and thread common candidates [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the placeholder menu's open, refresh, and accept paths with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]auto-versus-manual empty-prefix rule.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Distinct row styling, legend, and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wiring[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase polish — distinct rendering, legend, and docs' section: render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]common rows with their own badge and colour, add the two-source legend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the completion panel subtitle, add a PNG snapshot, and document the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]feature in ace.md, configuration.md, and the help popup.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-9m","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-9m.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-c1da9f042af26d8802f662be6b403718","started_at":"2026-07-25T16:45:49.371038+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1784999487,"sha":"9f8f04a4ae7f927447469de0674ebb2ca76d38dd","subject":"feat(history): add durable common-placeholder store (sase-9m.2)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"5daecd910659c78e55d54f89faa6e462926a36a65c6435dde9de668ce8299532","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9m.2/chat.md","size_bytes":5335},"commits":{"digest":"aeb07b0432ef33d67a133a401d3a09981548c87516da678836f89989d8a7a77d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-9m.2/commits.json","size_bytes":241},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200